[en.FOCUS_C07_LICENSED]
Special Business License

[en.FOCUS_C07_LICENSED_desc]
Shortly after the coronation of Cozy Glow, the new Empress has declared Las Pegasus a special Economic Zone, and has granted the a special business license to allow Flim and Flam’s Las Pegasus Consortium alone to operate in the city. Then, Flim became the Minister of Industry, while Flam became the Minister of Science and Magic.\nGreat news just came one after another! Next step, from Las Pegasus, to the world!

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LICENSED]
特许经营证

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LICENSED_desc]
和煦光流加冕后不久，这位新的女皇便宣布将洛马基设立为经济特区，授予了油嘴滑舌的洛马基财团独家经营权。随后，油嘴成为了工业部长，而滑舌则成为了科学与魔法部长。\n好消息简直是接踵而来！下一步，从洛马基，走向世界！

